Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by improper handling of the error thread (`errThread`) during the execution of shell commands in the `Shell.runCommand` method. Specifically, the original implementation did not adequately manage interruptions while waiting for the error thread to complete, which could lead to a deadlock situation if the thread was blocked or not able to exit properly.

